<title>CANADA: Viridian says calls shareholders meeting.</title>
<headline>Viridian says calls shareholders meeting.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viridian Inc said on Wednesday it will call a special shareholders meeting to be held in Toronto on December 10.</p>
<p>The meeting will be called to vote on the proposed merger between Viridian and Agrium Inc.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
